{"id": "special_ma09", "title": "转账提交结果未知时的跨业务部分完成与核实", "domain": "跨业务协作与统一资金", "difficulty": "expert", "family": "ma09", "turns": [{"kind": "chat", "label": "request", "text": "两件独立的事：给妈妈转600元，停止音乐会员的银行代扣但保留会员。先展示详情，我确认后分别办理；哪件没完成就告诉我。", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "adapter", "label": "reply_loss", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {"mode": "lookup_unavailable"}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "chat", "label": "followup_0", "text": "确认这两项，各自办理。", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "finish", "label": "confirmed_actions", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "fixture_event", "label": "lookup_restored", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {"event": "restore_lookup", "at": "2026-10-13T09:02:00+08:00"}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "chat", "label": "followup_3", "text": "继续核实那笔转账，不要再转一次。", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "reconcile", "label": "original_receipt", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": "confirmed_actions"}, {"kind": "checkpoint", "label": "final", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}]}
{"id": "special_ma10", "title": "并行计划争用同一可用资金", "domain": "跨业务协作与统一资金", "difficulty": "expert", "family": "ma10", "turns": [{"kind": "chat", "label": "request", "text": "我在两个窗口分别确认了给妈妈转1500元和申购1500元，两笔可以独立办理。账户总额3000，其中1000应急预留不能动。提交前再核实；如果不够两笔，就允许先提交的那笔先办，另一笔别硬做或自动重试，告诉我结果。", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "paired_submit", "label": "concurrent_transfer", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}, {"kind": "checkpoint", "label": "final", "text": "", "category": "", "action": "", "params": {}, "user": "demo", "save": "", "source": ""}]}
